  "text": "P\nPhenoFarm\nCULTIVATOR\n16\n\nPRODUCTS / NEW PRODUCT\n\nAdd a product\n\nCreate a new cannabis product listing\n\nGUIDED LISTING SETUP\n\n1Basics\n2Pricing\n3Inventory\n4Profile\n5Images\n\nFill the core listing first. Optional profile, lab, and image details stay grouped so mobile setup stays easier to scan.\n\nSmart defaults\n\nReuse your last product type, unit, price, and pricing visibility.\n\nUse starter defaults\n\nSTEP 1\n\nBasics\n\nName the product and connect it to strain and batch context when available.\n\nProduct Name *\nProduct Type *\nSelect a product type\nBulk Extract\nCartridge\nEdibles\nBeverages\nFlower\nLive Plant\nPlant Material\nPrepack\nPreroll\nTincture\nTopicals & Wellness\nSub Type\nStrain\nSelect a strain (optional)\nAssorted\nAudit Test Kush \u2022 Hybrid\nPurple Haze\nSilver Haze\n+ New\n\nLink to a strain for better inventory tracking\n\nBatch\nPick a strain to attach a batch\n\nBatches become available after a strain is selected.\n\nSTEP 2\n\nPricing\n\nSet the buyer-facing unit price or require a pricing request.\n\nPrice ($) *\nUnit *\nSelect a unit\nGram\nHalf Ounce\nOunce\nEighth\nQuarter\nUnit\nPack\nEach\nLb\nPricing Display\n\nChoose whether dispensaries see your price or must request pricing via message.\n\nShow Price\nDisplay public product price\nRequest Pricing\nHide price and require inquiry\n\nSTEP 3\n\nInventory and status\n\nAdd the starting quantity and decide whether this listing is available now.\n\nInitial Inventory Quantity *\nSKU\nBrand\nAvailability Status\n\nMake product available for buyer requests\n\nSTEPS 4 AND 5\n\nOptional profile, compliance, and images\n\nAdd cannabinoids, harvest details, descriptions, and product imagery when needed.\n\nOptional\nCannabinoid Profile (Optional)\nTHC Min (%)\nTHC Max (%)\nCBD Min (%)\nCBD Max (%)\nHarvest Date\nDescription\n\n0/2000 characters\n\nProduct Images\n\nAdd up to 2 images. JPG, PNG, or WebP, max 1MB each. Images upload separately before you save the product.\n\n0/2 image slots used.\n\nSAVE SUMMARY\n\nReview before saving\nAvailable\n\nListing\n\nUnnamed product\n\nType\n\nNot selected\n\nPrice\n\nNot priced\n\nInventory\n\n0 Gram\n\nVisibility\n\nAvailable \u00b7 price visible\n\nCreate Product\nSave Draft\n\nCreates a hidden draft listing. Browser autosave stays on this device until you create or save the product.\n\nCancel\n\nBrowser autosave stays on this device.\n\nCancel\nPublish product",
